WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.692
Step two. Connect a wallet.

2
00:00:02.692 --> 00:00:12.296
Open Connect wallet, and pick any Stellar wallet that is set to testnet. Freighter, Albedo, x Bull, Lobster and Scopuly are all listed.

3
00:00:12.296 --> 00:00:21.815
Extension wallets are marked as installed when your browser has them. Here we click Connect next to Albedo, a web wallet that runs on testnet.

4
00:00:21.815 --> 00:00:26.896
Albedo asks to share your public key. Approve it in the Albedo window.

5
00:00:26.896 --> 00:00:33.364
You're connected. The app remembers your wallet, and checks every signature against the testnet network.

